'''Galaxy''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Knife_Box_1 Knife Box 1] or through trading.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is made up of different shades of purple and stars, resembling the galaxy, hence the name. The guard is white, and the handle is solid black.
